WEBVTT

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:04.120
I knew...

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:05.750
...about the SCM.

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:08.870
We're here to challenge you to a duel.

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:11.750
We'll duel as a team, us against you two.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.370
The team who wins gets the losing team as their slaves.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.250
Why are you taking Seiya from me?

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:21.500
I'm not yours...

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.790
...not anymore!

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:25.870
Seiya.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:27.750
Julia!

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:31.410
I'm not letting you go, not again!

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.620
Hey...

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.410
I met someone after you broke up with me.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.910
Master Ryuuou.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.330
I belong...

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:44.950
-abuse-

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:44.950
...to Master Ryuuou now.

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:47.950
Wha... Ryuuou?

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:53.200
Is that an SCM?!

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:54.910
Why do you...

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:58.540
You can take out an SCM for short periods of time.

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:04.040
That's how I was able to get close to you
without the alarm going off.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:07.330
Seiya, I can't be with you anymore.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:13.040
I'm Master Ryuuou's slave now.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:14.540
I'm sorry.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:22.790
Was that the sensation of me losing?

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:24.660
When did we start a duel?!

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:26.040
We started it just now, remember?

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:29.080
You said you lose if you let go of my hand.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:33.660
What?! So that means I'm your slave now?!

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:37.410
No, you're not. I'm your temporary master.

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:43.500
When two slaves duel, the winner
temporarily becomes the other slave's master.

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:47.790
But once you meet Master Ryuuou,
my ownership will transfer,

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:50.580
and you will belong to Master Ryuuou.

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:54.250
Master Ryuuou came up with this idea, too.

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:58.870
That's how I made you my slave. Isn't that amazing?

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.790
You'll get to meet our Master soon, Seiya.

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:07.120
Until then, listen to what I say, okay?

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:13.700
I'll give this back to you after work.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:18.120
So don't you think about running away.

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:28.580
I want a heart that can laugh without lying

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:40.250
If I hadn't wanted anything from the start

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:47.950
Maybe my heart wouldn't have sank so low

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:56.830
I know the joy of being loved

00:02:56.830 --> 00:03:05.410
But it's not enough, it won't fill me up, it won't purge my fears

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:11.410
Won't you wet my bone-dry heart?

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:15.200
Pour the oil over it till it's overflowing

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:20.750
My scream echoes out in vain

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:26.950
I want to feel that this boring everyday life

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:30.620
Is a blessing bestowed upon me

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:43.080
I want a heart that can laugh without lying

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:51.200
There's something I want to show you.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:56.370
A little while after I got my SCMs, I found this site.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:02.620
It talks about all sorts of "experiments" they've done
with a slave wearing an SCM.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:09.830
They're trying to test the limits of what a slave will do.
It's pretty creepy shit, but, well...

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:06.700
Experiment
Log 12
I tied her arms
with barbed

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:06.700
leave a scar.

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:06.700
wire  and
left her
there for
the night.
Might

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:08.790
Experiment
Log 13
I pierced
her tongue
to see if
it'd hurt...

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:09.870
Experiment
Log 14

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:09.870
Tied down
and forced
to drink
water.
Vomited
after about
3 liters...

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:11.370
What the hell...

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.250
It made me wanna throw up when I read it, too.

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:21.000
This girl! Isn't she Seiya's ex?

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:23.000
That's what I thought.

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:30.500
When I looked into you, Seiya, I took a little time
to look into this Julia Katsushika girl.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.540
I never would've guessed
she was already someone's slave.

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:39.200
Seiya, did you know about this?

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:43.830
Who is Julia Katsushika's master?

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.080
Answer me, Seiya.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:48.200
This is an order.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:53.830
C'mon, Yuuga, don't make him suffer.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.500
Yeah, this seals the deal.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.580
What? What are you talking about?

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:03.160
The person conducting these experiments
is apparently called Ryuuou.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:08.830
Seiya disobeyed my order to answer my question.

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:12.580
He also didn't give me information about this Ryuuou.

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.410
That means...

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.200
Seiya isn't Yuuga's slave anymore.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.700
And his new master is probably...

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:21.700
...that Ryuuou.

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:25.750
No way... Seiya couldn't have entered into a duel
with someone else, right?

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:27.950
I mean, you ordered him not to, Yuuga!

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:31.870
He probably got forced into a duel somehow.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:36.450
Maybe he was threatened with his life,
or he didn't even realize he was in a duel.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:39.450
So why'd you come here and not say anything about it?

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.950
Seiya's probably acting as Ryuuou's spy right now.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:45.950
Seiya isn't wearing his SCM.

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:49.540
His Master probably took it out
so he couldn't be challenged to a duel.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:54.250
I can't challenge him, so I can't take him back.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:55.700
No...

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:59.160
Let's get out of here.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.580
We can't talk about this stuff in front of Seiya.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:06.500
Seiya.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:10.250
Tell this to your Master. To Ryuuou.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.250
Get ready for us.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:22.790
Please, Yuuga...

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.750
Get Julia...

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:27.580
Set her free from Ryuuou...

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:41.750
My, so you've come.

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:46.750
Would you care for tea? Or would you prefer coffee?

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:49.750
Oh, sure, coffee, please!

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:55.160
You called for me, Princess Shiori?

00:06:56.040 --> 00:07:00.080
Please bring my guest some coffee.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:04.120
Shiori
Adachi

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:10.120
This is a princess cafe, a new kind of cosplay cafe
following the trend of maid and butler cafes.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:13.500
The cafe's basic concept is Rococo-era princesses.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:18.120
The domineering and elegant way they interact
with customers is a real hit, and the cafe's thriving.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.000
Umm, Princess Shiori?

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.080
Yes, Dear?

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:26.410
You are so very wealthy, Princess,
and you have many servants to attend you.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:28.040
Yes, that is indeed so.

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:30.580
But I cannot say I know the exact number I possess.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:33.290
Still, this whole act...

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:36.910
It's so different from my real personality
that honestly, it's a real drag!

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:39.160
P-please, let me be your servant, too!

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:42.660
My servants live extremely hard lives.

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:47.080
Why, they're little more than slaves
who must fulfill my every command.

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:50.000
I-I'd want to be your slave!

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.540
Ugh, this is soooo annoying!

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:53.910
I'm off!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:00.450
Ugh, what am I gonna do tomorrow?

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.040
Now that I broke up with DJ...

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:06.830
Um...

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:12.410
Sorry to bother you so suddenly. You're Shiori-san, right?

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:14.500
Huh? Yeah.

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:17.080
Umm, I want to ask you something.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:20.580
Please make me your slave!

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.580
Huh? Uh-huh...

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:26.580
I'm not usually an M...

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:30.540
Actually, I think I'm more of an S with most people.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:36.000
But I realized that somewhere deep down,
I wanted someone who was more of an S than I was...

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.580
What's with this chick?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:41.120
That's why I wanted to be your slave so badly,
I got this SCM...

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:42.870
Hold on a sec.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:46.450
Oh, sorry, my name's Taiju Nakano.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:50.370
Forget about that. Why me? We just met.

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:55.660
You're really pretty and cool, Adachi-san,
and I just know!

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.950
I know you'll be the perfect mistress!

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:03.120
What's all this about making you a slave, anyway?
That's not really my fetish.

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:04.700
Here!

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:07.370
This is called an SCM.

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:11.290
If you wear this and beat someone in a duel,
they'll become your slave!

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:12.750
Uh huh...

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:14.830
Oh, don't worry or anything!

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:18.580
If you lose, I'll let you go right away!

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.870
Please put this on and duel me!

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:26.410
She's acting like this toy is the real deal.

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:29.370
This chick's gotta be crazy.

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:32.160
Just look at how worked up she is.

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:36.540
But if I let her go, she'll eventually get snatched up
by someone way scarier than me...

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:41.000
Sure, I've got nothing better to do tonight. I'll do it.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.410
Really?!

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:46.410
Okay, let's put in these SCMs! Just like this!

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:48.700
What?! You put it in your mouth?!

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.080
Yes!

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:59.000
Feels kinda weird.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.250
Okay, how should we duel?

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:06.500
Hmm, a duel? A duel, huh. Lemme think...

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:08.790
Sup, ladies!

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:12.500
Wanna come hang with us?

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.410
We could go to karaoke, or karaoke, or even karaoke!

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:15.660
Ugh, gross...
We could go to karaoke, or karaoke, or even karaoke!

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:16.750
Ugh, gross...

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:18.500
That's it!

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:24.500
Got it!

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:26.750
Our duel will be...

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:29.040
...whoever gets these guys
to spend the most on them wins!

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:34.450
Okay, where should we go? Karaoke sound good?

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:40.790
Where would they spend the most money on me...

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:42.120
Thanks!

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:45.330
I've always wanted to eat a crepe from here!

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:51.160
Adachi
Nakano

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:49.950
Not bad, Nakano-chan. Guess you got this game started.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:54.290
Hey, can we swing by Don Coyote?

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:55.910
Yeah, sure!

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:57.660
Don Coyote

00:10:57.830 --> 00:10:59.750
Oooh, this is so cute!

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:03.620
Aww, I want it so bad! I want it right now!

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:08.750
Wouldn't you rather get something like this
from someone you really love?

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:12.500
Now you're reacting normally?
After that whole pompous act?

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:16.000
Adachi-san, look what I got!

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:20.500
Adachi
Nakano

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:19.250
I got way too into it and spent 5000 yen.

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:21.870
Fine, then...

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:26.660
Whaddya think?

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:35.160
Cosplay
Shop

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:34.040
If you buy this for me, I'll wear it the rest of the day!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.580
Hell yeah I'll buy it!

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:36.160
Cosplay
Shop

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:36.160
Adachi
Nakano

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:37.660
Okay, then...

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:39.870
How's this?

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:42.910
Cosplay
Shop

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:44.160
Cosplay
Shop

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:44.160
Adachi
Nakano

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:47.660
Welcome home, Master!

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:50.660
Here's a menu for you to look at!

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.160
I'll have a draft beer.

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:55.330
Thank you for waiting!

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:56.660
Draft Beer

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:01.370
Okay, let's cast a spell on your drinks
to make them super yummy!

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:04.950
Refill, please!

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.290
A beer for me, too!

00:12:06.290 --> 00:12:07.160
I want fried chicken!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.580
Hey, girls, this ain't a bar...

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:11.950
I want takoyaki and dried squid!

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:12.950
And mackerel!

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:13.700
They don't got those!

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:16.660
Adachi
Nakano

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.660
Hey, you okay?

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:20.200
I'm fine, I'm fine, really.

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:21.950
My place is pretty close by.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:26.830
A doggy.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:30.700
It looks kinda sad.

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:32.330
Maybe it's hungry.

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:36.450
Oh, that's it! I took some of my chicken to go.

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:41.830
Here, eat this.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.620
This guy's not a stray.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.620
Zushiohmaru?

00:13:00.620 --> 00:13:03.660
Is that your name? Zushiohmaru?

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:09.450
He's so cute!

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.450
He's got something in his mouth...

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.250
The hell?

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:19.660
He ran off...

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:22.620
Thanks for having us!

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:27.410
Once we're outta booze, we can go to
the convenience store down the street and grab more!

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:28.620
Yeah!

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:33.410
The duel's until midnight, right?

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:36.790
I could drain three more bottles if I wanted.

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:40.450
Doesn't look like Nakano-chan can drink much more.

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:44.410
At this rate, I can win just by
getting them to buy me more booze!

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:46.910
Huh?

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:50.830
A..Adachi-san?!

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:52.870
Are you okay?!

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:58.620
Hey! What'd you do to her?!

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:02.410
Hey, you didn't put something in her drink, did you?

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:05.370
C'mon, this way's faster!

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:06.370
You...

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:07.870
DON'T FUCK WITH ME!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:23.660
Huh? Where...

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:26.040
Thank God.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:29.080
They drugged your drink.

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:34.000
Oh... guess that's the end of our duel, huh? Sorry.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.040
No, it's all my fault...

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.910
I dragged you into this.

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:45.160
Your beautiful hair's gotten all tangled up...

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.040
Huh?

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:48.410
Nakano-chan...

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:51.080
Are you a...

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.540
Never would've thought you were actually a guy.

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:08.540
I'm sorry I lied to you...

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:11.540
Huh? It's fine, really, it just took me off-guard.

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:18.040
She's hella cute and got way more money
off those guys than me, despite being a guy.

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:21.120
She completely beat me,
both in the duel and as a woman...

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.290
Are you okay?!

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:28.250
What the hell...

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:30.580
Did I really become his slave...?!

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.700
It vibrated!

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:35.910
Does that mean...

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:37.000
Hey!

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:53.000
Which one'a you's the master?

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:05.910
Taiju
Nakano

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.950
Shit... shit!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.450
Which one'a you's the master?

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.160
The hell is this guy?

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:25.700
Master...? Wait!

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:29.450
What're you talking about?
We're just drunk and chilling here.

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:30.410
C'mon!

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:33.450
Hold it.

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.080
Adachi-san!

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:37.950
You look like you're the master.

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.250
Let go of me!

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:42.700
Stop strugglin'!

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:45.370
Stop it!

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:51.950
Stay down.

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:55.250
I'm goin' easy on ya 'cause you're a woman.

00:16:55.790 --> 00:17:00.580
If you're actually a guy, I'll kill ya right here.

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:06.870
Alright. We're gonna have an SCM duel!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:09.620
The duel'll be a punch-out.

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:13.370
C'mon, say it. The duel'll be a punch-out.

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:16.250
Accept it or I'll just straight-up kill you.

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:18.750
What? That's crazy!

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:23.080
The duel... will be a punch-out.

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:25.830
Alright, let's get it started!

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.500
Stop... please, stop!

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:34.500
What was that?

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.750
I lose...

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:46.330
Alright! From now on, Slave,
you belong to me, Zenichi Bunkyo!

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:53.370
No...

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:59.250
Shiori's his slave...

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:00.040
Hey.

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:03.040
You're my slave now too, right?

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:05.370
What's he talking about?

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:09.790
I get it! He thinks Shiori-san's the master.

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.500
So he thinks I'm a slave, too.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.580
Hey, you listenin' to me?!

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:20.870
It's my fault this happened to Shiori-san...

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:23.540
But... if I don't do something...

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:28.580
Yes, I'm your slave.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:31.410
Alright, I got two!

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:33.660
Damn, that was a piece of cake.

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:37.120
Hey! Wait, dammit!

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:41.200
Shiori-san...

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:45.370
Shiori-san, I'm sorry...

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:48.200
I underestimated the SCM system...

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:51.660
I never imagined someone would
threaten someone into a duel...

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:55.540
Dammit... dammit!

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:59.160
I'm not strong enough to beat him.

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:03.040
But I've got to do something to help Shiori...

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:12.200
If you're being chased by someone,
you should take out your SCM.

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:16.200
Or else, they'll find you, like I just did.

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:23.870
Who're you?

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:27.540
I'm Julia.

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:32.200
If you don't mind, could you tell me what happened?

00:19:34.370 --> 00:19:38.410
If you want me to help her, I will, on one condition.

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:40.200
What is it?

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:43.580
I want you to be our ally.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:51.040
Okay. If you'll help Shiori-san...

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.330
Alright, let's go.

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:05.620
Don't worry. He's my helper.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.870
I'm Ataru Chuo.

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.580
Your name is Nakano, yes?

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:18.330
Sorry, but we haven't started to fully trust you yet.

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:19.200
But...!

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:20.620
But I'm not lying!

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:24.750
First, we want you to duel with Julia.

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:25.580
Huh?

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:30.120
To make sure you'll keep your promise
and become our ally.

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:34.040
If we save Adachi-san, then I win.

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.120
That works, right?

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:40.750
That means we have to save Adachi-san.

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:43.000
Alright. Let's duel.

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:47.830
The two of them are in this park.

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:50.250
There are three signals!

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.250
Someone else is there with them?!

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:56.250
Another SCM wearer showed up?

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:10.250
Shiori-san!

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.830
Ya piece of shit!

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.080
Is that Zenichi?

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:18.410
What's he doing? What's he fighting?

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:19.910
Huh?

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:22.040
A dog?!

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:23.410
Zushiohmaru!

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:24.700
You know that dog?

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:27.330
He's a lost dog that Adachi-san fed.

00:21:27.330 --> 00:21:28.410
His name was written on his collar.

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:31.580
I see. The dog's the only one there.

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:32.910
I don't know what its goal is.

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:36.160
Fuck!

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:40.790
Ow!

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:47.540
Fuck, why's this dog attacking me?!

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:51.790
Stop!

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:54.160
Lemme go!

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.540
Don't tell me... I lost?

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:04.080
Me? The invincible Zenichi...?

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:07.330
I'm this mutt's slave?!

00:22:18.450 --> 00:22:22.000
-abuse-

00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:28.660
The ultimate game is testing my heart

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:33.450
A strategy that starts from a one-on-one

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:36.120
It's getting close, do I attack or pull back

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:37.910
Play defense or offense on the brink?

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:41.040
Tell me, which is better?

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:45.290
I don't care if the rules leave me without a chance

00:22:45.290 --> 00:22:51.500
I have one last chance in my hand for my unclear future

00:22:51.500 --> 00:22:56.660
Does the deck in front of me shine light on that future?

00:22:57.330 --> 00:23:06.250
Examining your visible and hidden expression, my fate concealed

00:23:06.250 --> 00:23:11.410
Drawing forth luck, I don't want to lose

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:15.160
I can't evolve if I keep saying "I can't"

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:19.790
I'll win my game with you

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:27.620
And overcome all barriers, so I never go bust again

00:23:37.450 --> 00:23:42.410
-plan-
